h d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-T9kIB5hi\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ffYDKFG8\">仅支持查询广告主有权限访问的商品库 支持「商品推广」的推广目的包含：应用推广（APP）、销售线索收集（LINK）、电商店铺（SHOP）、商品推广（DPA） 其中仅商品推广（DPA）支持<strong>多商品推广，其余仅支持单商品推广</strong></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-51N7BLZ0\">商品库行业类型为小说<code><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">NOVEL</span></code>、招商加盟<code><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">RCHANTS</span></code>、直播社交<code><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">LIVE</span></code>、教育<code><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">EDUCATION</span></code>、新汽车<code><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">AUTO_NEW</span></code>、视频咨询<code><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">VIDEO</span></code>的时候，<strong>不可以投放多商品广告</strong></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-E3kbapb1\">商品库行业类型为新汽车<code>AUTO_NEW</code>的时候，<strong>单商品和多商品推广均不可以投放</strong></li></ol></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201772463659928584%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-MPY8XDk8\" id=\"h346b9f0-MPY8XDk8\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-YctrExrk\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/dpa/product/availables/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px